Description: Fix GCC 15 consteval errors with MakeFixedFlatSet/Map and std::string
 GCC 15's consteval functions cannot use std::string because it involves heap
 allocation at compile time. This patch fixes multiple locations where
 base::MakeFixedFlatSet or base::MakeFixedFlatMap are used with std::string
 types by switching to std::string_view, or using runtime helper functions.
 .
 Files fixed:
 - net/device_bound_sessions/cookie_craving.cc (MakeFixedFlatSet<string>)
 - components/autofill/.../autofill_structured_address_component.cc
   (MakeFixedFlatSet<AddressCountryCode>)
 - components/autofill/core/browser/geo/generate_country_native_names.cc
   (generator outputs string_view instead of string)
 - components/autofill/core/browser/geo/country_names.cc
   (consumer adaptation for string_view values)
Author: Juan Manuel Mendez Rey <vejeta@gmail.com>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2025-12-01

